  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_8159429e-ca19-436c-b96d-9be266ff6d9f.png\" alt=\"Better Fantasy\" width=\"808\" height=\"335\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_17d612e5-257c-4d36-9008-0ba57597ed5d.png\" alt=\"总览\" width=\"850\" height=\"150\"></strong></p>\n<h4>Better Fantasy 旨在通过添加新的魔法机制、Boss、建筑和生态群系，打造一个“原版+”的中世纪奇幻世界。游戏还加入了起源选择功能，提供多种奇幻背景供你挑选，助你打造独特的游戏体验。</h4>\n<h4>本整合包所选用的模组经过精心筛选，旨在营造《我的世界》中的奇幻氛围，同时避免功能重叠或冲突。我希望打造一个中等体量的奇幻整合包，力求内容不至于过于庞大繁杂，让玩家能够深入体验每一个模组，同时保持足够的多样性，确保每位玩家都能乐在其中。</h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_ec6950ec-aba5-4bec-bdf4-470e2ab23497.png\" alt=\"功能特色\" width=\"850\" height=\"150\"></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<p>✨ 独特的起源系统，打造专属玩法（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-origins-revival\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Medieval Origins Revival</a>）</p>\n<p>✨ 全新维度（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper And Darker</a>）</p>\n<p>✨ 重制主世界与下界生态群系（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystics-biomes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mystic's Biomes</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tectonic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tectonic</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/luminous-nether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Luminous Nether</a>）</p>\n<p>✨ 彻底重制末地（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stellarity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stellarity</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endremastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">End Remastered</a>）</p>\n<p>✨ 全新生物（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythic-mounts-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Mounts</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dragon Mounts Legacy</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Naturalist</a>）</p>\n<p>⚔️ RPG 元素（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/auto-leveling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Auto Leveling</a>）</p>\n<p>⚔️ 新护甲与装饰特效（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trimseffects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TrimEffects</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Armor</a>）</p>\n<p>⚔️ 新 Boss、地下城与建筑（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses Of Mass Destruction</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeon-now-loading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeon Now Loading 2%</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-seven-seas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise - Seven Seas</a>）</p>\n<p>⚔️ 魔法机制（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</a>）</p>\n<p>📜 100+ 任务</p>\n<p>📜 任务商店：使用完成任务获得的金币进行消费</p>\n<p>📌 体验优化功能（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bonfires\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bonfires</a>）</p>\n<p>📌 专为性能优化设计（支持可选光影）</p>\n<p>👑 100+ 模组</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_c18620d1-9e30-4f8a-adb1-ff9f869c4007.png\" alt=\"游戏截图\" width=\"850\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_58e4ae1e-c168-4631-868d-4e29c4c7c0cc.png\" alt=\"传说生物\" width=\"845\" height=\"475\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_b7564036-174c-4eef-8baf-f931356a9b38.png\" alt=\"虚空之花\" width=\"845\" height=\"475\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_77359753-ad72-4a1a-ac80-706e710c0dcc.png\" alt=\"光辉下界\" width=\"845\" height=\"475\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_23757c5e-cc5f-483b-b8ab-e053526fc701.png\" alt=\"光辉下界\" width=\"845\" height=\"475\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_48ba35eb-63d1-4b05-b79d-85f9bd1045cd.png\" alt=\"中世纪建筑\" width=\"845\" height=\"436\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_0d409873-880e-4b19-ac2f-719e335a3cec.png\" alt=\"北欧维京建筑\" width=\"845\" height=\"472\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ABHWJj7w9W\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_00780d7c-41b4-4dbe-a8d4-4242310492bd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"150\"></a></p>\n<p>欢迎加入官方 Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/ABHWJj7w9W\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/ABHWJj7w9W</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>已知问题</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>与 Embeddium 不兼容</li>\n<li>与 Optifine 不兼容</li>\n<li>请勿更新模组，否则整合包将无法正常运行</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
